WEBVTT

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.360
<i>Hanamaru Kindergarten</i>

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.230
The pool is going to be so much fun.

00:01:38.270 --> 00:01:39.170
I know, right?

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.470
Your swimsuit is cute, Anzu-chan.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:47.740
It really is.

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:51.630
Today's my big chance. I'm giving it my best shot.

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:52.820
Your best shot?

00:01:53.000 --> 00:01:57.310
Today's my first visit to a pool with Tsuchi. I'm going to knock him out with this swimsuit.

00:01:57.820 --> 00:01:58.860
I see.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:01:59.960
Knock him out?

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.140
Looks like everyone's changed.

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.540
You can head to the pool once you've put your things away.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:08.370
Okay.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:10.670
What about you, Yamamoto-sensei?

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.870
I'll go once I change into my swimsuit.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:23.690
Huh?

00:02:23.890 --> 00:02:25.420
"A Hanamaru Pool"

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:31.500
Hey! No running around the pool!

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:32.840
Okay.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.790
A day at the pool with Yamamoto-sensei...

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:43.400
We can do this and that at the pool.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:46.860
Yeah, right.

00:02:47.010 --> 00:02:48.080
Hey, Tsuchi.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:53.580
What do you think of this swimsuit?

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:55.310
Looks cute.

00:02:56.510 --> 00:02:58.720
He called me cute!

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:01.500
Do I look sexy?

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:03.670
Maybe.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.000
Hooray!

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:10.310
Did you knock him out?

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:13.950
I got him good! He said I looked sexy.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.220
That's great.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.150
That's some swimsuit, Hii-chan.

00:03:18.210 --> 00:03:21.220
A full-body swimsuit for complete UV protection...

00:03:21.950 --> 00:03:23.260
...and fins.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:24.590
Awesome!

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.440
UV protection?

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.760
How impressive.

00:03:29.210 --> 00:03:30.680
Sorry I'm late.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:38.040
"Composure"

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:38.040
Yamamoto-sensei didn't disappoint.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:41.160
It's even more than I had hoped for.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:49.190
Sorry I'm late.

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.460
Not at all.

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.600
I'm looking forward to working with you today.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:54.600
The pleasure is mine.

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:00.860
Uh, nothing.

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.560
Oh, this swimsuit?

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:07.140
I accidentally brought the wrong swimsuit.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.630
There's nothing wrong with it.

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:11.470
It's a great swimsuit.

00:04:11.790 --> 00:04:14.600
Yamamoto-sensei's swimsuit is wonderful.

00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:16.070
Y-yes.

00:04:17.240 --> 00:04:19.800
Anzu-chan, now's the time.

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.040
Oh, right.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.460
You have great taste.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:23.980
Tsuchi.

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:27.150
Yes, yes. You're cute.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:31.550
You're absolutely radiant in that swimsuit.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:36.890
Really? I suppose the brightness of this swimsuit could be blinding.

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:40.070
There he goes again.

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:43.260
I don't want to grow up to be like him.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:45.810
Tsuchida, let's swim already!

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:47.290
Sure.

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.150
Okay, everyone. Let's warm up.

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:51.400
Okay.

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:53.110
Giraffe.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:54.420
Giraffe.

00:04:55.030 --> 00:04:56.020
Giraffe.

00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.310
Giraffe.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.430
Elephant.

00:04:59.780 --> 00:05:00.840
Elephant.

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:03.790
Rabbit.

00:05:04.290 --> 00:05:05.420
Rabbit.

00:05:05.580 --> 00:05:06.810
Rabbit.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.090
Rabbit.

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:10.830
Okay, you can get in now.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:18.010
Hey! Don't jump in!

00:05:18.370 --> 00:05:19.570
We're fine.

00:05:19.570 --> 00:05:20.420
Let's go.

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:26.690
You can't always get what you want.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:33.800
Koume-chan?

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.170
What's wrong, Koume? Are you afraid of the water?

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:56.600
What's wrong, Anzu?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.040
Aren't you having fun?

00:05:59.160 --> 00:06:02.850
This isn't fun. Come swim with me, Tsuchi.

00:06:03.070 --> 00:06:03.860
I can't.

00:06:04.180 --> 00:06:04.980
Why not?

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:07.490
I've been assigned to watch everyone.

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.650
It's Yamamoto-sensei's job to play with you.

00:06:10.190 --> 00:06:11.650
That's no fun.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:14.030
Well, for our next pool day...

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.940
Good job.

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:17.160
Just a little more. You can do it.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.410
You did it.

00:06:22.340 --> 00:06:24.360
Tsuchi, what were you saying?

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:26.780
Huh? What was I talking about?

00:06:29.110 --> 00:06:31.160
Looks like you're having fun now.

00:06:31.540 --> 00:06:35.130
Darn it, Tsuchi!

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:41.200
I need to do something to win back Tsuchi's love.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.460
You'll never beat Yamamoto-sensei's sexiness.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:47.980
There must be another way.

00:06:50.020 --> 00:06:50.810
Summer?

00:06:50.940 --> 00:06:51.820
Swimsuit.

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.330
Cute girl.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:55.410
Not sexy.

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:59.820
"Synchronized swimming..."

00:06:57.380 --> 00:06:59.820
"The Japanese Summer Olympics synchronized swimming team's swimsuits features a cute girl mascot..."

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.440
I've seen it on TV.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:09.210
They all dance together in the water.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:11.980
Yes, that is synchronized swimming.

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:17.080
Synchronized swimming, a contest of women's beauty.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:20.760
Tsuchida-sensei won't be able to take his eyes off you.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.770
Synchronized swimming sounds great. I'll do it.

00:07:26.890 --> 00:07:28.840
Just watch, Tsuchi.

00:07:46.080 --> 00:07:48.750
You should be careful if you don't know how to swim.

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.390
But...

00:07:54.110 --> 00:07:56.500
Come on, blow your nose.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.670
Thank you, Tsuchi.

00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.360
Don't worry about it. Blow your nose.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.140
Okay.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:08.590
It looks like synchronized swimming got her closer to Tsuchida-sensei after all.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:09.870
I guess it worked out okay.

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:12.330
Are you okay, Anzu-chan?

00:08:15.490 --> 00:08:17.790
Did Anzu-chan swallow some water?

00:08:18.030 --> 00:08:22.190
Oh, she's fine. She just got some in her nose.

00:08:22.290 --> 00:08:26.060
Darn it, Tsuchi!

00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:29.750
That jerk.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:34.240
Tsuchida-sensei comes to your rescue when you're in trouble.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:39.360
Anzu-chan, are you prepared to risk your life?

00:08:47.990 --> 00:08:51.940
Days like this make life worth living.

00:08:52.030 --> 00:08:53.530
Tsuchida-sensei.

00:08:54.570 --> 00:08:55.890
What's wrong, Koume?

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:57.710
Anzu-chan is in trouble.

00:08:57.890 --> 00:09:00.300
Did she try synchronized swimming again?

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:01.400
No!

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:03.710
She's in much bigger trouble.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.520
Could she be hurt?

00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:11.420
It's my fault for taking my eyes off her.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:13.170
Sensei, over there.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:21.120
Save me, Tsuchi! I'm going to be eaten by a shark!

00:09:23.780 --> 00:09:25.600
Save me!

00:09:35.460 --> 00:09:37.770
Thanks for saving me, Tsuchi.

00:09:45.830 --> 00:09:49.360
Why did you do that? I was really worried about you.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:55.920
Because...

00:09:56.990 --> 00:10:01.000
Because you were giving all your attention to Yamamoto-sensei.

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:06.540
I just wanted you to pay attention to me.

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:16.550
Sorry, Anzu!

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.330
I'm really sorry!

00:10:24.260 --> 00:10:25.690
I'll never forgive you.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:27.900
It was my fault.

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:31.070
Really?

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:32.520
Really.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:35.460
Will you stop looking at Yamamoto-sensei in her swimsuit?

00:10:36.560 --> 00:10:38.640
Yamamoto-sensei's swimsuit?

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.480
Yamamoto-sensei, behind you.

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:53.840
Are you okay, sensei?

00:10:58.030 --> 00:10:59.760
Hey, Tsuchi!

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:02.190
Sorry, sorry.

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:04.570
You said you wouldn't look any more!

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:06.100
Sorry, sorry.

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.950
Anzu-chan's got a rough love life.

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:11.710
"A Hanamaru Gambit"

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:13.950
I'm home.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:17.730
Mayumi, you switched out my swimsuits, didn't you?

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:21.750
I bet Tsuchida-san liked that bikini.

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:23.880
Yes, he did.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:25.440
What'd he say?

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:29.760
He said I was radiant. Why?

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:34.850
What do you mean, why? He liked how your body looked in that bikini.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:40.570
What are you talking about? Tsuchida-sensei was praising my swimsuit, not me.

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:46.670
Don't you go home with Tsuchida-sensei all the time?

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:50.290
Yes. We often end up leaving at the same time.

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:53.820
Nana-chan, those aren't coincidences.

00:11:55.010 --> 00:11:57.410
Didn't he invite you to an amusement park the other day?

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:00.330
Yes. He had a leftover ticket...

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:06.120
...but I told Tsuchida-sensei Anzu-chan had been wanting to go.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:10.770
I'm telling you, he was trying to ask you out on a date.

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:14.390
You're always so dense, Nana-chan.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:20.810
Tsuchida-san's going to have a hard time with you.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:30.690
"Hanamaru Kindergarten"

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:34.120
This must be it.

00:12:39.610 --> 00:12:42.840
What a cute kindergarten.

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:45.920
I mean, this must be it.

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:54.630
Tsuchi, what are we going to do today?

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:56.540
I wonder.

00:12:56.800 --> 00:12:57.740
Tsuchida-sensei?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:58.460
Yes.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:01.310
There's a cute guest here to see you.

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:04.700
Who? Who is this cute person?

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:14.550
Satsuki?

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:22.330
Brother, didn't I tell you to put the key in the mailbox today?

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.340
I forgot.

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:26.830
What a stupid brother.

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.670
"A Hanamaru Brother"

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:36.130
On top of that, you left dry laundry out on the balcony.

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:39.960
I bet you haven't ironed that shirt, either.

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:43.110
The button's starting to come off. Have you even been cutting your hair?

00:13:43.350 --> 00:13:44.400
It's a mess.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:48.580
It's been years since you left home, but you still can't take care of yourself.

00:13:48.880 --> 00:13:50.610
I'm embarrassed to call you my brother.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:53.950
I can't say anything to that.

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:57.240
Who is she?

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:59.060
She appears to be Tsuchida-sensei's younger sister.

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:01.660
Tsuchi's younger sister?

00:14:02.310 --> 00:14:04.220
She's pretty.

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:08.520
If you marry Tsuchida-sensei, she'll become your little sister.

00:14:08.730 --> 00:14:10.040
Really?

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.750
I can't be sure you're even doing your job right.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:16.230
I'm managing that one pretty well.

00:14:16.390 --> 00:14:18.380
Would you like to observe a class?

00:14:19.030 --> 00:14:22.600
What? Won't I get in your way?

00:14:23.000 --> 00:14:26.340
Not at all. I'm sure the children would enjoy it, too.

00:14:28.050 --> 00:14:29.350
W-what?

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:32.650
Nice to meet you. I'm Anzu from the Sakura Class.

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:34.890
N-nice to meet you.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.880
I'm going to be Tsuchi's wife.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:39.630
I said it!

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.620
H-his wife?

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:45.890
I may not know much, but I'll do my best.

00:14:46.290 --> 00:14:50.020
Once we get married, you'll be my little sister.

00:14:50.140 --> 00:14:50.860
What?

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:52.590
Let's play.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.670
Hold on. Brother!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.110
Why don't we have you stay just for free time?

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:00.320
What?

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.050
Thanks in advance.

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:06.860
Good grief.

00:15:07.230 --> 00:15:11.090
You're it, okay? Let's play tag!

00:15:12.050 --> 00:15:13.680
Huh? W-wait.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:16.320
Over here!

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:32.340
We're over here!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:35.630
Children are powerful.

00:15:35.800 --> 00:15:38.720
I'm amazed my brother keeps up with this hard job.

00:15:40.680 --> 00:15:42.480
Did Tsuchida-sensei fall asleep?

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:45.320
What do you think you're doing?

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:49.930
Oh, sorry. I was up late last night.

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:53.060
You idiot!

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:55.550
Give us horsey rides next!

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.460
I'm supposed to get the goddess' prayer.

00:16:07.090 --> 00:16:08.400
What should I do?

00:16:08.470 --> 00:16:11.500
You've got to look at the treasure map.

00:16:11.790 --> 00:16:14.140
The swordsman Deparudo has it.

00:16:15.730 --> 00:16:17.020
Hey!

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:22.460
I'm helping the children learn to communicate.

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:26.850
Is this what you do every day?

00:16:27.640 --> 00:16:30.070
Not every day.

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.340
He was playing a different game yesterday.

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.450
You idiot!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.840
What a disappointment.

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:53.170
How do you think Tsuchida-sensei is doing?

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.850
It was exactly as I imagined.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:58.590
He can't do anything right.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:00.550
Is that so?

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:05.870
I hope he isn't causing trouble for the other teachers or the children.

00:17:06.220 --> 00:17:12.510
If you're worried about someone, the negative aspects tend to stand out.

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:14.070
You think so?

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:17.950
My younger sister gets annoyed with me.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:22.470
I'm not exactly sure why she feels that way, though.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:27.030
Right here.

00:17:34.390 --> 00:17:36.550
It hurts.

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:40.260
What's wrong?

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:44.070
I thought you're going to be an Animal Ranger when you grow up.

00:17:46.360 --> 00:17:49.060
Animal Rangers are strong and cool.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:52.930
Yeah. Red is especially cool.

00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:55.940
Animal Rangers don't cry, even if it hurts.

00:17:56.430 --> 00:17:58.400
Yeah. I won't cry.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:02.850
Okay, who wants to play Animal Rangers?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:08.870
Now we're going to make animals out of clay.

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:10.780
Okay.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:24.330
I don't have enough clay. I want to make a huge dinosaur.

00:18:24.390 --> 00:18:25.360
Me too.

00:18:28.070 --> 00:18:33.330
Why don't you boys combine your clay and make a big one together?

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.160
Good idea.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.430
Let's do it.

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:39.740
I'm making a classy apartment.

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.240
It's my home sweet home with Tsuchi.

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:43.650
Oh, wow.

00:18:46.260 --> 00:18:47.450
Hey, Koume.

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:49.860
Come here.

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.140
Okay.

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:55.530
I'm stepping out for a bit.

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:57.030
Okay.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:18:58.950
Where's he going all of a sudden?

00:18:58.970 --> 00:19:00.630
"Restroom"

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:02.460
Are you done?

00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.240
Yes. Thank you, sensei.

00:19:05.390 --> 00:19:06.690
I did it.

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:07.650
Good girl.

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:09.700
Thank you for coming with me.

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:12.810
It's hard to leave for the bathroom when you're with your friends.

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:16.500
Next time, I'll say I want to go to the bathroom myself.

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:16.500
Huh.

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:19.110
He does do a good job.

00:19:27.820 --> 00:19:32.000
I just threw something together, but it's still better than a convenience store lunch, right?

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:38.370
Delicious.

00:19:38.640 --> 00:19:41.550
Me too. I want to have some, too.

00:19:42.090 --> 00:19:45.410
Sure. She makes some great boiled dishes.

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:51.550
This is really good.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.470
Isn't it?

00:19:53.070 --> 00:19:54.310
R-really?

00:19:57.510 --> 00:19:59.190
This really is great.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.450
I can't be that good.

00:20:01.220 --> 00:20:02.670
I want more.

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:06.350
It'd be great if I could eat this every day.

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:09.080
Well...

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:13.260
...you could have that every day if you'd come home.

00:20:13.260 --> 00:20:14.780
That was delicious.

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:18.620
It was great to eat something made with human touch again.

00:20:18.170 --> 00:20:20.120
Thanks for the food.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:22.100
He wasn't listening.

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:27.770
You jerk!

00:21:56.930 --> 00:21:58.820
I'm at the kindergarten, mother.

00:21:59.670 --> 00:22:02.310
Yes, he's doing well.

00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:05.270
It's getting late, so I'm going to stay here.

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:06.500
Okay.

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:12.170
I'm staying overnight at my brother's apartment.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:13.950
"A Hanamaru Sleepover"

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:24.990
This is your first night staying here, right?

00:22:25.280 --> 00:22:25.870
Yeah.

00:22:26.420 --> 00:22:28.140
It's a little messy.

00:22:33.060 --> 00:22:34.580
You call this "a little?"

00:22:35.210 --> 00:22:36.640
You mean it's not?

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:41.290
This isn't just a little at all. Look at all the laundry you've got piled up.

00:22:41.490 --> 00:22:43.210
Here, take this over there.

00:22:45.450 --> 00:22:47.930
And throw out your raw garbage every day.

00:22:48.370 --> 00:22:49.230
Okay, okay.

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:54.520
I'm beat.

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:56.500
It's because you leave all your chores to be done at once.

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:02.430
Oh, sorry I don't have anything other than white shirts.

00:23:03.180 --> 00:23:04.160
Seriously.

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:07.400
I'm turning the lights out.

00:23:07.510 --> 00:23:08.130
Okay.

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:14.690
My brother's shirt.

00:23:18.140 --> 00:23:20.720
I forgot to wash the sheets and comforter.

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:22.180
They stink of sweat.

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.070
You idiot!

00:23:25.070 --> 00:23:26.380
What?

00:23:30.710 --> 00:23:33.110
Some things never change.

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:35.430
I guess I was impressed by his performance at work, though.

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:36.980
He seems serious about his job.

00:23:37.090 --> 00:23:38.490
I'll give it my best, too.

00:23:38.880 --> 00:23:40.720
Sakura-san, you're up next.

00:23:40.720 --> 00:23:41.500
Okay.

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:44.790
Next week's episode is about summer vacation and fireworks. Don't miss it.

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:43.530
"A Hanamaru Summer Vacation"

00:23:43.530 --> 00:23:44.790
"A Hanamaru Summer Festival"

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:48.630
"See you next week!"
